# Browser
# Bot1 casts Ob Nixilis, the Adversary in the browser with a 2/2 (Woodland Changeling) and a 1/1 (Dryad Arbor) out. The additional cost is
# offered as "Cast without casualty" beside "Casualty X: ..."; after choosing casualty the X announcement is captioned for what X is -
# the least power of the creature sacrificed (CR 702.153a) - with no mana wording ("not enough mana for it" would be false: X is no mana's).
# X is stepped to 2 and announced, and the sacrifice offers only the 2/2. Both Obs end on the battlefield, the token with loyalty 2 and the
# original, legendary, with 3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Woodland Changeling
Dryad Arbor
Ob Nixilis, the Adversary
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

